+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+- `sites` contains site records with string `id` and `name`. Each location has
+  a `site` referring to a site id; location ids remain globally unique.
+- Schema 2 migrates to schema 3 by creating `main` ("Main kitchen") and
+  assigning every existing location to it. Schema 1 upgrades through schema 2.
+- Batches and stock-takes belong to a site through their location. Stock on
+  hand, cooking, alerts and stock value use only that site's batches. Items,
+  suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
